"2026-09-06T21:51:11Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/AU-Avengers/TOU-Mira/releases/download/1.7.3/TouMira.v1.7.3-x86-steam-itch.zip\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/AU-Avengers/TOU-Mira/releases/assets/547721292\",\"id\":547721292,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOOq1A-84gpZBM\",\"name\":\"TownOfUsMira.dll\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-msdownload\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":40690176,\"digest\":\"sha256:2e043c95ca9963dd6344913cb79a40d59a607d0bf13faf0ae15f7c435b7c5a6f\",\"download_count\":576,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-06T21:42:22Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-06T21:42:24Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/AU-Avengers/TOU-Mira/releases/download/1.7.3/TownOfUsMira.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/AU-Avengers/TOU-Mira/tarball/1.7.3\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/AU-Avengers/TOU-Mira/zipball/1.7.3\",\"body\":\"# This release can be installed on top of the previous release.\\r\\n### Crewmate Role Bugfixes:\\r\\n- Sheriff: Fixed broken punishment explanation in tab description.\\r\\n- Altruist: Fixed broken tab description.\\r\\n- Mirrorcaster: Magic Mirrors no longer stay permanently if the Mirrorcaster is converted.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Impostor Role Bugfixes:\\r\\n- Morphling: If configured, the Morph ability uses are no longer able to go less than 0.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Neutral Role Bugfixes:\\r\\n- Survivor: Survivor no longer takes wins away from Impostors.\\r\\n- Plaguebearer: Adjusted checks to rule out the possibility of duplicate plague on a player.\\r\\n- Werewolf: Werewolf\u0027s short-burst kill cooldown is no longer affected by cooldown changes.\\r\\n- Chef: Added safeguards against the possible occurrence of missing dead bodies, breaking the win conditions.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Draft Mode Bugfixes:\\r\\n- Target-based roles like Fairy and Executioner have targets assigned properly again.\\r\\n- Concurrent picks no longer removes picks from other player.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Other Bugfixes:\\r\\n- Fixed bad AU code causing anti-cheat to kick non-hosts if they voted for someone who died in the meeting.\\r\\n- Fixed non-classic roles appearing in the settings menu.\\r\\n- Fixed missing causes of death appearing due to locale system changes.\\r\\n- Fixed Assailant Modifier Options text.\\r\\n- Fixed kill cooldown for Impostors not being based on overall cooldown offsets.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Main Changes:\\r\\n- Added Ghostwalker Auto-Venting setting upon spawning under Game Mechanics.\\r\\n- Added Judge\u0027s punishment as a setting for Prosecutor\u0027s punishment (now the default).\\r\\n- Reshuffling in Draft Mode gives you spare time to pick if necessary.\\r\\n# This release can be installed on top of the previous release.\"}","cachedLatestVersion":"1.7.3","lastChecked":"2026-09-25T23:56:12.9537993Z"},"ChaosTokens":{"cachedETag":"W/\"3c4c71708f5d67a20774d050c811c84785db0b53fc0403710cb951e01f1290f4\"","cachedReleaseData":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/xChipseq/ChaosTokens/releases/387619097\",\"assets_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/xChipseq/ChaosTokens/releases/387619097/assets\",\"upload_url\":\"https://uploads.github.com/repos/xChipseq/ChaosTokens/releases/387619097/assets{?name,label}\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/xChipseq/ChaosTokens/releases/tag/1.2.2\",\"id\":387619097,\"author\":{\"login\":\"xChipseq\",\"id\":108542751,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOBng7Hw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108542751?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/xChipseq\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/xChipseq/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"node_id\":\"RE_kwDOPYU-ms4XGpkZ\",\"tag_name\":\"1.2.2\",\"target_commitish\":\"main\",\"name\":\"1.2.2\",\"draft\":false,\"immutable\":false,\"prerelease\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-12T15:45:18Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-12T15:46:15Z\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-12T15:46:15Z\",\"assets\":[{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/xChipseq/ChaosTokens/releases/assets/559509377\",\"id\":559509377,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOPYU-ms4hWW-B\",\"name\":\"ChaosTokens.dll\",\"labe