:44Z\",\"assets\":[{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/All-Of-Us-Mods/MiraAPI/releases/assets/543615592\",\"id\":543615592,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOL7G7yc4gZupo\",\"name\":\"MiraAPI.dll\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-msdownload\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":2120704,\"digest\":\"sha256:6f0e713b876feb128f197975e45ce23d3f0a735b067aaa2596d35f61501ff92d\",\"download_count\":682,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:36:47Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-04T01:36:48Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/All-Of-Us-Mods/MiraAPI/releases/download/0.5.0/MiraAPI.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/All-Of-Us-Mods/MiraAPI/tarball/0.5.0\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/All-Of-Us-Mods/MiraAPI/zipball/0.5.0\",\"body\":\"## Major Changes\\r\\n- Updated API for Among Us v18 (Judge Update)\\r\\n- Implemented Translation system for all strings, including roles. (PR #91)\\r\\n- Added Judge-like (Targeted) and Detective-like (Untargeted) meeting abilities (PR #102)\\r\\n- Added RpcFramedMurder and RpcAdvancedCustomMurder for further configuration.\\r\\n- Implemented Gamemodes system. (PR #17)\\r\\n## Other Changes\\r\\n- Improved existing Role Info Guide from the base game.\\r\\n- Added \\\"Display Wiki on Bottom Row\\\" toggle.\\r\\n- Added \\\"Top-Right UI Scale\\\" slider.\\r\\n- Added Bundle SubAsset Sprite support for spritesheets.\\r\\n## Bugfixes\\r\\n- Fixed broken vanilla options menu displaying modded options at the same time.\\r\\n- Fixed the first role appearing broken in the modded role settings tab.\\r\\n- Fixed role spawn logic not assigning basic Impostor if no roles were enabled.\\r\\n- Fixed crashes happening on Epic Games and MS Store when roles were assigned to players.\\r\\n- Material shader properties are now cached properly (PR #100)\\r\\n## Translation Progress\\r\\n- Nearly / Fully Complete Translations: Chinese (Simplified and Traditional), German, Polish, Portuguese (Portugal), and Spanish (LATAM).\\r\\n- Partial Translations: Dutch, French, Italian, Korean, Russian, and Spanish.\"}","cachedLatestVersion":"0.5.0","lastChecked":"2026-09-25T23:56:22.9985119Z"},"Submerged":{"cachedETag":"W/\"03a654ab6146ef889762d7999841adca37a111239d675070883b36b88d8db094\"","cachedReleaseData":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/263853551\",\"assets_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/263853551/assets\",\"upload_url\":\"https://uploads.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/263853551/assets{?name,label}\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/tag/v2025.11.20\",\"id\":263853551,\"author\":{\"login\":\"Alexejhero\",\"id\":32238504,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjM4NTA0\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.