/Alexejhero/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-zip-compressed\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":78556360,\"digest\":\"sha256:f0c495c5ab1865b5646dc29538fe497fb675b13e9f26f8ba68c37c2c2b9d7d1d\",\"download_count\":7954,\"created_at\":\"2025-11-20T19:14:24Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-20T19:15:28Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/download/v2025.11.20/Submerged%2Bdependencies.Steam.Itch.zip\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/assets/318901015\",\"id\":318901015,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOHJUYsM4TAgsX\",\"name\":\"Submerged.dll\",\"label\":null,\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"Alexejhero\",\"id\":32238504,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjM4NTA0\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32238504?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/Alexejhero\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Alexejhero/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/octet-stream\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":46597632,\"digest\":\"sha256:c9597d2191198f5fc5d5d0552eb71358adb4ec4cab69e82956b6c99a1c4c69df\",\"download_count\":9168,\"created_at\":\"2025-11-20T19:14:04Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-20T19:14:17Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/download/v2025.11.20/Submerged.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/tarball/v2025.11.20\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/zipball/v2025.11.20\",\"body\":\"### Changelog\\r\\n- Updated to Among Us v17.1\\r\\n- Fixed the Detective role not working on Submerged\\r\\n- Fixed the Noisemaker role not working on Submerged\\r\\n- Fixed the Admin table not showing players in Lounge\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n[See Installation Instructions](https://github.com/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/tree/v2025.11.20#installation)\\r\\n\\r\\nThis version of Submerged requires the following dependencies:\\r\\n| Dependency | Version |\\r\\n|:-:|-|\\r\\n| BepInEx | [`v6.0.0-be.735`](https://builds.bepinex.dev/projects/bepinex_be#:~:text=#735) |\\r\\n| Reactor | [`v2.5.0`](https://github.com/NuclearPowered/Reactor/releases/tag/2.5.0) or later |\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003e [!Note]\\r\\n\u003e If you are downloading the DLL only, please note that you will need different versions of BepInEx depending on the platform that you play Among Us on. If you have Among Us on Steam or Itch.io, you need the `Unity (IL2CPP) for Windows (x86) games` version of BepInEx. Otherwise, if you have Among Us on Epic or Microsoft Store, you need the `Unity (IL2CPP) for Windows (x64) games` version.\\r\\n\u003e\\r\\n\u003e Alternatively, you can download the ZIP files, which already include the right version of BepInEx, as well as Reactor.\",\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/SubmergedAmongUs/Submerged/releases/263853551/reactions\",\"total_count\":27,\"+1\":6,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":2,\"hooray\":1,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":15,\"rocket\":1,\"eyes\":2}}","cachedLatestVersion":"v2025.11.20","lastChecked":"2026-09-25T23:56:24.1593563