:80537729,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTM3NzI5\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80537729?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/discus-sions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/discus-sions/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-msdownload\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":690176,\"digest\":\"sha256:b433cb282519ebc1bb862e5734ffe247b86bc0b9a65eb77317d1314a11a62166\",\"download_count\":172,\"created_at\":\"2026-04-11T22:08:25Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-11T22:08:28Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/Lotus-AU/LotusContinued/releases/download/v1.7.2/VentFrameworkContinued.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotus-AU/LotusContinued/tarball/v1.7.2\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotus-AU/LotusContinued/zipball/v1.7.2\",\"body\":\"## Notice:\\r\\nPlease restart your game after the first launch of the mod, there is currently a bug where the game will get stuck trying to end the game and your GUI buttons will flash. This only occurs on the first launch of the game after installing the mod.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Announcement:\\r\\nProject: Lotus is now available on Android! You can download it through Starlight, we have a tutorial on our YouTube channel which goes through how to set it up. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e6rYQQyfKxs\u0026t=40s\\r\\n\\r\\n## Minor Additons\\r\\n- Added Turncoat as a banned role from Rogue\\r\\n- Added 4 More Hats by Dp\\r\\n\\r\\n# Bug Fixes\\r\\n- Fixed issues relating to changing roles during game\\r\\n- Fixed Viper not being considered an impostor role\\r\\n- Fixed some compatibility issues\\r\\n\\r\\n# Known Bugs\\r\\n- **You may be kicked randomly while in-game, we are investigating this.\\r\\n- **Rarely**, players may blackscreen at the start of the game or after meeting. The cause of this is usually ping.\\r\\n- **Sometimes**, Mastermind may still kill you even if you already killed someone else.\\r\\n- **Rarely**, players may be teleported into walls. The cause of this is usually roles like Escapist where you mark positions too close to walls.\\r\\n- **Rarely** when shapeshifting, players might still have their original name.\\r\\n- Romantic\u0027s win-condition may bug out sometimes, meaning you won\u0027t win with your partner.\\r\\n- Players cannot sabotage Crash Course on Airship.\\r\\n- Most translations aren\u0027t 100% complete.\\r\\n\\r\\n# For The Future\\r\\nThis release is just a **preview of what’s to come**, we’re still actively developing new features and improvements before we exit beta.\\r\\nHere is a list of things we plan to include in the future.\\r\\n- Fungle Support (you can *apparently* play the map right now, but there are issues so please don\u0027t bother reporting)\\r\\n- Updating Modded Client Compatibility\\r\\n- Add New Roles \u0026 Other Content\\r\\n- In game Mod Updater\\r\\n- Add more Languages\\r\\n- New Hats\\r\\n- **Bug Fixes**\\r\\n\\r\\n**If you are developer, you can actually add your own content without modifying PL!**\\r\\nWe have added support for addons, and you can learn more info at this [GitHub Repo](https://github.com/Lotus-AU/SampleLotusAddon)!\\r\\nYou can check out addons made by others from the [#community-content](https://discord.com/channels/1017870413545607209/1311955640528146492) forum channel.\\r\\n\\r\\n**If you are a translator, you can add languages!**\\r\\nWe have a [repository](https://github.com/Lotus-AU/Languages) dedicated for language files. Check it out if you are interested!\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\nWelcome back to Lotus!\\r\\n#### [Website](https://lotusau.top) | [Discord](https://discord.gg/projectlotus)\"}","cachedLatestVersion":"v1.7.2","lastChecked":"2026-09-25T23:56:30.8138707Z"},"PropHunt":{"cachedETag":"W/\"303a1caec6a0b3561233c1f20a92308c7bde4e24a138c6efb853bfed7f770dc2\"","cachedReleaseData":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/ugackMiner53/PropHunt/releases/289290040\",\"assets_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/ugackMiner53/PropHunt/releases/289290040/assets\",\"upload_url\":\"https://uploads.github.com/repos/ugackMiner53/PropHunt/releases/289290040/assets{?name,label}\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ugackMiner53/PropHunt/releases/tag/v2026.2.23\",\"id\":289290040,\"author\":{\"login\":\"ugackMiner53\",\"id\":55325485,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzI1NDg1\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55325485?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ugackMiner53\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner53/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/ugackMiner