DOKl8EQ84cTPil\",\"name\":\"AUnlocker_v1.3.1_Steam_Itch.zip\",\"label\":null,\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"astra1dev\",\"id\":90265231,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjY1MjMx\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90265231?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/astra1dev\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/astra1dev/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/zip\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":32150061,\"digest\":\"sha256:e73bd1fe58a168af26dcee47fbf06a521c30bc6ea0075eff74bb7efe06319e67\",\"download_count\":9778,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-12T22:55:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-12T22:55:17Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/releases/download/v1.3.1/AUnlocker_v1.3.1_Steam_Itch.zip\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/astra1dev/AUnlocker/tarball/v1.3.1\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/astra1dev/AUnlocker/zipball/v1.3.1\",\"body\":\"This release is compatible with Among Us version `17.4.0` (`2026.6.5`) and `18.0.0` (`2026.8.18`)\\r\\n\\r\\n# 📝 Release Notes\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/compare/v1.3.0...v1.3.1\\r\\n* Add Classic / Nostalgia Mode by @Mungles337 in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/132\\r\\n* New CHANGELOG.md file\\r\\n* Recognize Starlight platform when finding a game.\\r\\n  Previously, if MoreLobbyInfo was enabled, lobbies where the host is playing on Starlight would show \\\"Unknown\\\" as platform\\r\\n* Remove [Cake](https://cakebuild.net/) as it was never needed (we\u0027re just using `dotnet build` in GitHub Actions now)\\r\\n* Split `PatchChat` into multiple config options (`ChatKeyboardShortcuts`, `AllowSymbols`, `HigherCharacterLimit`, `LowerChatCooldown`)\\r\\n* Bump AmongUs.GameLibs.Steam from 2025.11.18 to 2026.3.31 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/118\\r\\n* chore: bump actions/upload-artifact from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/114\\r\\n* Bump AmongUs.GameLibs.Steam from 2026.3.31 to 2026.6.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/123\\r\\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/131\\r\\n\\r\\n## New Contributors\\r\\n* @Mungles337 made their first contribution in https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/pull/132\\r\\n\\r\\n# 💾 Installation\\r\\nRead [this section](https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker?tab=readme-ov-file#-installation) for installation instructions.\\r\\n- If you have Among Us on **Steam or Itch.io**, download `AUnlocker_v1.3.1_Steam_Itch.zip`\\r\\n- If you have Among Us on **Epic Games, Microsoft Store or Xbox App**, download `AUnlocker_v1.3.1_EpicGames_MicrosoftStore_XboxApp.zip`\",\"discussion_url\":\"https://github.com/astra1dev/AUnlocker/discussions/143\",\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/astra1dev/AUnlocker/releases/352863518/reactions\",\"total_count\":8,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":3,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":4,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":1},\"mentions_count\":2}","cachedLatestVersion":"v1.3.1","lastChecked":"2026-09-25T23:56:36.7842883Z"},"EndlessHostRoles":{"cachedETag":"W/\"1a348f93e4dd9760b4346e24e7e18