iptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Rabek009/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Rabek009/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Rabek009/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/Rabek009/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-msdownload\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":800768,\"digest\":\"sha256:a2b2d5e673d4d0a358fa293c3979c45cea75d8d18a8f0fd5b0c281d3ada3eac9\",\"download_count\":515,\"created_at\":\"2025-09-24T20:11:36Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-24T20:11:37Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/Rabek009/MoreGamemodes/releases/download/2.1.1/MoreGamemodes.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Rabek009/MoreGamemodes/tarball/2.1.1\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Rabek009/MoreGamemodes/zipball/2.1.1\",\"body\":\"**Added guesser mode! (classic only)**\\r\\n\\r\\n**Added new add on: Guesser**\\r\\n\\r\\nImprovements:\\r\\n- Shaman and judge roles now use shift button instead of kick menu\\r\\n- Added \\\"Should continue the game\\\" options to multiple roles\\r\\n- Added more assign options to bait add on\\r\\n- As oracle now players who confessed have orange name and the others checked have yellow name\\r\\n- Added \\\"Minimum players alive for ability use\\\" option to oracle role\\r\\n- Added \\\"See kill attempt alert\\\" option to medic role\\r\\n- Changed default options for some roles\\r\\n\\r\\nBug fixes:\\r\\n- Fixed next bomb exploding too early after player with bomb disconnected\\r\\n- Fixed shapeshifter having wrong name color while shapeshifted in hide and seek\\r\\n- Fixed potential rate limit kicks in jailbreak\\r\\n- Camouflage should now always fully work\\r\\n- Fixed potential disconnects caused by sending custom options\\r\\n- Fixed \\\"Preset\\\" option not saving after restarting the game\\r\\n- Fixed _/cs_ command not working on noisemaker/phantom/tracker counts and chances\\r\\n- Fixed bugs with custom meeting buttons\\r\\n- Bug with not getting pet at start should be fixed\\r\\n- Ninja can now use his ability during sabotage \"}","cachedLatestVersion":"2.1.1","lastChecked":"2026-09-26T00:02:32.3708436Z"},"Impostor":{"cachedETag":"W/\"5c73ff4c3a00885cb5178633516974f8237a72ce46f7e79dd9e79767dc7eb2f9\"","cachedReleaseData":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Impostor/Impostor/releases/379342341\",\"assets_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Impostor/Impostor/releases/379342341/assets\",\"upload_url\":\"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Impostor/Impostor/releases/379342341/assets{?name,label}\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/Impostor/Impostor/releases/tag/v1.10.8\",\"id\":379342341,\"author\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"node_id\":\"RE_kwDOEbZc3c4WnE4F\",\"tag_