800a3353e226be8a6b999e1e3a9c6ba9afaf722d49978536\",\"download_count\":1718,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T21:42:03Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-18T21:42:06Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/artriy/Perfect-Comms/releases/download/v4.1.10/PerfectComms.dll\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/artriy/Perfect-Comms/releases/assets/522587638\",\"id\":522587638,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOSdz6cM4fJg32\",\"name\":\"PerfectCommsStarlight.test.dll\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"artriy\",\"id\":43206073,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjA2MDcz\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43206073?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/artriy\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/artriy/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/x-msdownload\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":14514688,\"digest\":\"sha256:6780200f504bbec6bd073e5297aa500f46f97e07715ad3e7ae77f055edf1b4b9\",\"download_count\":92,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:53:12Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-20T17:53:49Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/artriy/Perfect-Comms/releases/download/v4.1.10/PerfectCommsStarlight.test.dll\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/artriy/Perfect-Comms/tarball/v4.1.10\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/artriy/Perfect-Comms/zipball/v4.1.10\",\"body\":\"Perfect Comms v4.1.10 supports the new Among Us v18 meeting player identifiers while retaining compatibility with validated pre-v18 releases.\\n\\n\u003cp align=\\\"center\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003cimg src=\\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artriy/Perfect-Comms/v4.1.10/assets/brand/divider.svg\\\" alt=\\\"divider\\\" width=\\\"900\\\"\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n### Among Us v18 Compatibility\\n\\n- **Meeting voice features continue to identify the correct player on both old and new Among Us releases.**\\n  \u003e \u003csub\u003eAmong Us v18 replaced each meeting card\u0027s byte `TargetPlayerId` with an `InnerNet.PlayerId` value. Perfect Comms now resolves and caches whichever representation the running game exposes, normalizes it to the existing byte identity, and avoids a static dependency on either member. This keeps meeting speaking indicators, public-death roster updates, and identity-privacy checks available on v18 without dropping the validated pre-v18 path.\u003c/sub\u003e\\n\\n\"}","cachedLatestVersion":"v4.1.10","lastChecked":"2026-09-26T00:02:53.1575705Z"},"MiraNotePad":{"cachedETag":"W/\"5dde8a034966eeba2be429efe4939801bf0489bbaf01045d837a8555013ded14\"","cachedReleaseData":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Maxi0fc/Mira-NotePad/releases/388077460\",\"assets_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Maxi0fc/Mira-NotePad/releases/388077460/assets\",\"upload_url\":\"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Maxi0fc/Mira-NotePad/releases/388077460/assets{?name,label}\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/Maxi0fc/Mira-NotePad/releases/tag/v1.4.3\",\"id\":388077460,\"author\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/gi